WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.647
Here is one defensible e-commerce analysis direction
Device type

00:00:05.661 --> 00:00:11.203
is nominal and works naturally with one-hot encoding
Membership tier

00:00:11.216 --> 00:00:16.746
is ordinal when the business defines a real ranking
Session duration is

00:00:16.773 --> 00:00:23.669
a ratio measurement Purchase count is a discrete
ratio count Weekday

00:00:23.696 --> 00:00:30.214
often behaves as a cyclical category because Sunday
connects back to Monday Revenue

00:00:30.227 --> 00:00:34.819
should use an exact numeric storage type with
currency documented separately
